# SPEC-CODEX-HOME-BACKSLASH-001 / card t571 — post-absorb SKIP baseline

Purpose: AC-CHB-006 compares an exact SKIP count. The pre-M2 pin (`skip-baseline-pre-m2.log`,
SKIP_COUNT=30 @ ee194493f) was measured BEFORE this worktree absorbed local develop. The absorb
brought in t577, which edits `internal/cli/todo.go` — inside the counted package — so that pin no
longer describes this tree. This file is the re-pin AC-CHB-006's re-pin rule requires.

